{
  "about": "The gh stand-in's answers (test/support/stubs/gh.py) for the repo acme/widgets, the Add Repo sheet's calls: its probe (default branch, top-level files, mix.exs), then the WORKFLOW.md pull request (base commit, branch, commit, pull request, and deleting the branch after a failure). The first entry whose args match a call answers it; a * inside an argument matches any text. status (default 200) and output are what the fake gh prints: stdout with exit status 0 for a 200, stderr with exit status 1 otherwise. See test/support/README.md.",
